{"kp_id": "zj-023.kp0001", "video_id": "zj-023", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "足三里补泻按经气流向，勿死记顺/逆时针（左右腿相反）：顺经快转慢回为补，逆经为泻。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st36", "method.bu_xie", "meridian.st"], "chapter_id": "zj-023.c01", "evidence_quote": "不要去说什么，顺时针逆时针这样会搞错", "seg_from": 21, "seg_to": 67, "start_s": 104.87, "end_s": 369.885, "citation": {"youtube_id": "UXaMALTo2BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXaMALTo2BY&t=104s", "series": "zj", "episode": 23, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\" - Acupuncture, Episode 23 of 90", "start_s": 104.87, "end_s": 369.88}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-023.kp0002", "video_id": "zj-023", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "补用单数捻转（三五七九）后将针稍上提如绿豆许，气下行更快。", "entity_ids": ["method.bu_xie"], "chapter_id": "zj-023.c01", "evidence_quote": "转三下转五下，转七下转九下，补完以后", "seg_from": 23, "seg_to": 23, "start_s": 119.08, "end_s": 129.895, "citation": {"youtube_id": "UXaMALTo2BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXaMALTo2BY&t=119s", "series": "zj", "episode": 23, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\" - Acupuncture, Episode 23 of 90", "start_s": 119.08, "end_s": 129.9}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-023.kp0003", "video_id": "zj-023", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "足三里为合穴属土、又为本穴，虚实皆可治；常灸可保胃气、助长寿。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st36", "zangfu.wei"], "chapter_id": "zj-023.c01", "evidence_quote": "常常灸足三里的是那一个人健康长寿", "seg_from": 26, "seg_to": 75, "start_s": 140.74, "end_s": 419.695, "citation": {"youtube_id": "UXaMALTo2BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXaMALTo2BY&t=140s", "series": "zj", "episode": 23, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\" - Acupuncture, Episode 23 of 90", "start_s": 140.74, "end_s": 419.69}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-023.kp0004", "video_id": "zj-023", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "血压偏高可于足三里下约半寸处以四十五度斜刺向足三里，有助阳气下行。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st36"], "chapter_id": "zj-023.c01", "evidence_quote": "足三里下五分的地方半寸量，然后真是斜刺", "seg_from": 72, "seg_to": 73, "start_s": 387.92, "end_s": 408.625, "citation": {"youtube_id": "UXaMALTo2BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXaMALTo2BY&t=387s", "series": "zj", "episode": 23, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\" - Acupuncture, Episode 23 of 90", "start_s": 387.92, "end_s": 408.62}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "真是=针是", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-023.kp0005", "video_id": "zj-023", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "上巨虚善治乳房硬块；下巨虚善治脐下结块（如胞宫肿块）；限在胃经者尤宜。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st37", "acupoint.st39"], "chapter_id": "zj-023.c02", "evidence_quote": "上巨虚呢穴道顾名思义这个对我们的乳乳房的硬块非常好", "seg_from": 198, "seg_to": 204, "start_s": 1020.27, "end_s": 1056.65, "citation": {"youtube_id": "UXaMALTo2BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXaMALTo2BY&t=1020s", "series": "zj", "episode": 23, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\" - Acupuncture, Episode 23 of 90", "start_s": 1020.27, "end_s": 1056.65}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-023.kp0006", "video_id": "zj-023", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "条口在上、下巨虚之间（上巨虚下一寸）；条口透承山专治肩不能举。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st38", "acupoint.bl57"], "chapter_id": "zj-023.c02", "evidence_quote": "条口透沉三专专门道五十间", "seg_from": 274, "seg_to": 280, "start_s": 1382.788, "end_s": 1416.528, "citation": {"youtube_id": "UXaMALTo2BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXaMALTo2BY&t=1382s", "series": "zj", "episode": 23, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\" - Acupuncture, Episode 23 of 90", "start_s": 1382.79, "end_s": 1416.53}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "沉三=承山；五十间=手不能举", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "zj-023.kp0007", "video_id": "zj-023", "type": "acupoint_usage", "statement": "丰隆可助丰满美容（需隔日疗程、宜补不宜泻），更是著名祛痰穴。", "entity_ids": ["acupoint.st40"], "chapter_id": "zj-023.c02", "evidence_quote": "最有名的丰隆穴的资质就是祛痰", "seg_from": 307, "seg_to": 318, "start_s": 1577.068, "end_s": 1649.343, "citation": {"youtube_id": "UXaMALTo2BY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UXaMALTo2BY&t=1577s", "series": "zj", "episode": 23, "title": "Ni Hai-sha \"Human Record\" - Acupuncture, Episode 23 of 90", "start_s": 1577.07, "end_s": 1649.34}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "资质=主治", "source": "llm_read"}
